10. THE LAW

```
    Two agree           → reinforce
    Two oppose          → HOLD
    Only one agrees     → wait
    Third still moving  → inhibit
```

Implementation: the toroid's Hc is the threshold. The flip is the IN signal. No comparators.

Each flip injects a current pulse into the SUM node. Threshold at ±1.5 pulses. PERMIT fires.

