23. THE MEASUREMENTS

· Static balance — CENTER read from the toroid's flipped state. Record.
· Write shift — apply pulse. Measure shift. Record.
· Retention — wait. Measure again. If shift persists, memory is present.
· Reinforcement — apply 10 pulses. If shift increases, the path is deepening.
· Recovery — E = ½C(V_final² − V_initial²). Report the fraction raw.

